Package: pulsar-dmg-viewer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: p7zip-full, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-pil
Suggests: pulsar-appexec
Description: Native DMG viewer, Applications visualizer and macOS runtime manager for Pulsar OS
 Provides full graphical DMG mounting and visual inspection, Applications grid
 viewer for macOS apps, and on-demand installation of the macOS compatibility runtime.
